msgid "More themes to set a CV or a portfolio in, beside Postulo's own: one a hiring system reads cleanly and one laid out as the Europass CV is. Switched off, the themes are no longer offered, and a document set in one of them is drawn in the plain theme until it is switched on again."
msgstr "Postuloren beraren gaiez gain, CV bat edo portfolio bat osatzeko gai gehiago: bat kontratazio-sistema batek garbi irakurtzen duena eta bestea Europass CVaren antzera antolatua. Desaktibatuta, gaiak ez dira eskaintzen, eta horietako batean osatutako dokumentu bat gai soilean marrazten da berriz aktibatu arte."

